{"schemaVersion":1,"source":"tmdb","kind":"episodes","input":{"mediaId":70311,"seasonNumber":3},"checkedAt":1793454821726,"status":"ok","retryCount":0,"value":{"seasonNumber":3,"name":{"value":"Stagione 3","language":"it-IT"},"year":2018,"episodeCount":12,"poster":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/rn7wUK97iZh5fwNatd2NbGxjTZV.jpg","posters":[],"backgrounds":[],"episodes":[{"id":"1603370","seasonNumber":3,"episodeNumber":1,"title":{"value":"Episodio 1","language":"it-IT"},"overview":{"value":"经历了风雨动荡之后，博城早已面目全非。博城政府决定将幸存者迁往魔都和古都，莫凡一家人来到魔都。莫凡入住后，唐月打电话邀请莫凡与她合作，处理戏水镇的怪事。戏水镇最近突然大旱，经查是火系灵种玫炎在作祟。有两个势力前来夺取玫炎，但皆被杀人魔朝赫击败。","language":"zh-CN"},"airDateText":{"value":"2018-10-24","language":"it-IT"},"runtimeMinutes":18,"rating":9,"thumbnail":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w300/nOPJEC6ftaj0dvdgM9kc4x1Eco0.jpg","stills":[{"type":"still","url":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/nOPJEC6ftaj0dvdgM9kc4x1Eco0.jpg","language":"xx"}],"sourceUrl":"https://www.themoviedb.org/tv/70311/season/3/episode/1"},{"id":"1611581","seasonNumber":3,"episodeNumber":2,"title":{"value":"Episodio 2","language":"it-IT"},"overview":{"value":"唐月和莫凡本打算“坐收渔翁之利”，但朝赫的出现令唐月冲上前去，与其战斗。由于唐月低估了朝赫的实力，不幸被朝赫击垮。正当唐月命悬一线之际，三下五除二，解决了朝赫，莫凡获得火系灵种玫炎。","language":"zh-CN"},"airDateText":{"value":"2018-10-13","language":"it-IT"},"runtimeMinutes":20,"rating":8,"thumbnail":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w300/59qAUhGsbmh6CjVc1SpEPj7nXKT.jpg","stills":[{"type":"still","url":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/59qAUhGsbmh6CjVc1SpEPj7nXKT.jpg","language":"xx"}],"sourceUrl":"https://www.themoviedb.org/tv/70311/season/3/episode/2"},{"id":"1611582","seasonNumber":3,"episodeNumber":3,"title":{"value":"Episodio 3","language":"it-IT"},"overview":{"value":"唐月为感谢莫凡的救命之恩，赐予莫凡二次觉醒的机会。莫凡前往东方明珠魔法塔，觉醒了暗影系和召唤系，并且苦修一年并准备用召唤系考入明珠学府。在明珠学府入学考试时，莫凡遇到了对手罗宋，莫凡首次使用召唤系，召唤出了幽狼兽。","language":"zh-CN"},"airDateText":{"value":"2018-10-20","language":"it-IT"},"runtimeMinutes":19,"rating":8,"thumbnail":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w300/3zk89fK8Ay4fucR9vvmdXOueXoF.jpg","stills":[{"type":"still","url":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/3zk89fK8Ay4fucR9vvmdXOueXoF.jpg","language":"xx"}],"sourceUrl":"https://www.themoviedb.org/tv/70311/season/3/episode/3"},{"id":"1611583","seasonNumber":3,"episodeNumber":4,"title":{"value":"Episodio 4","language":"it-IT"},"overview":{"value":"罗宋毫不示弱，施展出了冰系中阶魔法，正当罗宋将幽狼兽重伤时，莫凡施展出雷系中阶魔法，罗宋落荒而逃，莫凡也成功进入召唤系。不久后，召唤系的新生为主角的斗兽大赛开幕了，但莫凡的幽狼兽却重伤无法参战。","language":"zh-CN"},"airDateText":{"value":"2018-10-27","language":"it-IT"},"runtimeMinutes":18,"rating":8,"thumbnail":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w300/3QOugiEWbwwsREbygbDE8onyPVc.jpg","stills":[{"type":"still","url":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/3QOugiEWbwwsREbygbDE8onyPVc.jpg","language":"xx"}],"sourceUrl":"https://www.themoviedb.org/tv/70311/season/3/episode/4"},{"id":"1611584","seasonNumber":3,"episodeNumber":5,"title":{"value":"Episodio 5","language":"it-IT"},"overview":{"value":"斗兽大赛中，召唤系共7人参战。其余6人跃跃欲试，均以失败而告终。此时，莫凡的幽狼兽醒了，展现出不凡的实力。","language":"zh-CN"},"airDateText":{"value":"2018-11-03","language":"it-IT"},"runtimeMinutes":18,"rating":8,"thumbnail":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w300/gIyIkpteOqYJ69jxS3xOF7wPrER.jpg","stills":[{"type":"still","url":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/gIyIkpteOqYJ69jxS3xOF7wPrER.jpg","language":"xx"}],"sourceUrl":"https://www.themoviedb.org/tv/70311/season/3/episode/5"},{"id":"1635396","seasonNumber":3,"episodeNumber":6,"title":{"value":"Episodio 6","language":"it-IT"},"overview":{"value":"莫凡和幽狼兽轻松打败了对手们，任务晋级为“迎接全系200人的轮番轰炸”。最终莫凡打败了中阶“女神”法师牧奴娇，莫凡取得了胜利，得到了所有资源以及丰厚的奖励。","language":"zh-CN"},"airDateText":{"value":"2018-11-27","language":"it-IT"},"runtimeMinutes":19,"thumbnail":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w300/rP1iuscf3YXV4geuMUQpNi60PJZ.jpg","stills":[{"type":"still","url":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/rP1iuscf3YXV4geuMUQpNi60PJZ.jpg","language":"xx"}],"sourceUrl":"https://www.themoviedb.org/tv/70311/season/3/episode/6"},{"id":"1635397","seasonNumber":3,"episodeNumber":7,"title":{"value":"Episodio 7","language":"it-IT"},"overview":{"value":"莫凡了获得了兽靴以及前往三步塔修炼的资格。莫凡因缺钱而去报名城市猎妖师，但被告知资历不够，只好在介绍下去了魔都有名的青天猎所。莫凡与猎人大师灵灵前去调查一件灵异事件：有一对夫妇，分别于上午和下午来到猎所后纷纷说对方有问题，包老头便让灵灵和莫凡调查此事。","language":"zh-CN"},"airDateText":{"value":"2018-12-04","language":"it-IT"},"runtimeMinutes":18,"rating":8,"thumbnail":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w300/ewQ0HxyCERDfnwaSU7xSSV9IOtz.jpg","stills":[{"type":"still","url":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/ewQ0HxyCERDfnwaSU7xSSV9IOtz.jpg","language":"xx"}],"sourceUrl":"https://www.themoviedb.org/tv/70311/season/3/episode/7"},{"id":"1642605","seasonNumber":3,"episodeNumber":8,"title":{"value":"Episodio 8","language":"it-IT"},"overview":{"value":"莫凡和灵灵二人组成搭档，调查此事件。二人来到了夫妇住处的小区，灵灵通过之前偷偷潜入屋子安装的微型摄像机发现二人是一对鳞皮妖夫妇。莫凡利用遁影潜入夫妇家中，将二人引出窗外，在空中用烈拳攻击坠落下来的鳞皮妖夫妇。鳞皮母妖用鳞皮公妖挡在了自己面前，鳞皮公妖被轰死，鳞皮母妖却逃之夭夭。二人开始追踪鳞皮母妖，之后二人发现竟是一个寄生妖魔，具有传染性。","language":"zh-CN"},"airDateText":{"value":"2018-12-15","language":"it-IT"},"runtimeMinutes":18,"rating":8,"thumbnail":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w300/mqI2L9N79fSA03ZIIZb0M7t7E6s.jpg","stills":[{"type":"still","url":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/mqI2L9N79fSA03ZIIZb0M7t7E6s.jpg","language":"xx"}],"sourceUrl":"https://www.themoviedb.org/tv/70311/season/3/episode/8"},{"id":"1682038","seasonNumber":3,"episodeNumber":9,"title":{"value":"Episodio 9","language":"it-IT"},"overview":{"value":"明珠学府的体育场正在举行明星演唱会，鳞皮母妖隐匿于其中，传染了许多人。莫凡一路杀过去，意外遇到了赵满延。此时，二人决定合力对付鳞皮妖。","language":"zh-CN"},"airDateText":{"value":"2018-12-30","language":"it-IT"},"runtimeMinutes":18,"rating":8,"thumbnail":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w300/hjk0yU9e6nasByayzw1VFcl58Xa.jpg","stills":[{"type":"still","url":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/hjk0yU9e6nasByayzw1VFcl58Xa.jpg","language":"xx"}],"sourceUrl":"https://www.themoviedb.org/tv/70311/season/3/episode/9"},{"id":"1682040","seasonNumber":3,"episodeNumber":10,"title":{"value":"Episodio 10","language":"it-IT"},"overview":{"value":"鳞皮妖闯入屋子，赵满延与莫凡合力击败了妖魔。为防止传染扩散，猎者联盟和校方将体育馆封锁。由于青校区的学生大多是初阶魔法师，诛杀妖母的任务就交给了莫凡。莫凡和赵满延一路杀到三楼，赶上了即将进场的女明星醋醋。即将通过升降台到达舞台的醋醋，发现控制升降台的人就是潜伏已久的鳞皮母妖。","language":"zh-CN"},"airDateText":{"value":"2019-01-03","language":"it-IT"},"runtimeMinutes":18,"rating":8,"thumbnail":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w300/dklcpJBtoVw1dFSbihicCfoDtTa.jpg","stills":[{"type":"still","url":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/dklcpJBtoVw1dFSbihicCfoDtTa.jpg","language":"xx"}],"sourceUrl":"https://www.themoviedb.org/tv/70311/season/3/episode/10"},{"id":"1682042","seasonNumber":3,"episodeNumber":11,"title":{"value":"Episodio 11","language":"it-IT"},"overview":{"value":"正当醋醋即将丧命之际，莫凡出场救下醋醋，并与妖母战斗。莫凡低估了妖母的实力，莫凡与战将级妖母久战不克。醋醋用闪光灯给莫凡制造阴影，莫凡成功用烈拳击中妖母，之后莫凡使用巨影钉使其无法移动，最终莫凡使用霹雳送其归西。","language":"zh-CN"},"airDateText":{"value":"2019-01-23","language":"it-IT"},"runtimeMinutes":18,"rating":8,"thumbnail":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w300/pYOcmskeypOtO86aVld9SeMieaH.jpg","stills":[{"type":"still","url":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/pYOcmskeypOtO86aVld9SeMieaH.jpg","language":"xx"}],"sourceUrl":"https://www.themoviedb.org/tv/70311/season/3/episode/11"},{"id":"1868100","seasonNumber":3,"episodeNumber":12,"title":{"value":"Episodio 12","language":"it-IT"},"overview":{"value":"危机解除了，但莫凡把功劳给了赵满延，赵满延在学校内出了名。之后，赵满延带领莫凡前往拍卖行。在拍卖会上赵满延送给莫凡雷系灵种“千钧”；莫凡击杀妖母而获得的战将级精魄也出售成功。之后莫凡成了有钱人，与牧奴娇合租了一套精美公寓。几天后，莫凡带领心夏到西湖看雪，心夏向莫凡讲述了博城的历史：博城自古以来就拥有地圣泉，最初进入博城的人就是地圣泉的守护者。随着时间的推移，守护者早已销声匿迹；亦或者整个博城的居民，都是地圣泉的守护者。想要了解真相，必须进入著名的陵墓——古都陵墓中去寻找。","language":"zh-CN"},"airDateText":{"value":"2019-01-23","language":"it-IT"},"runtimeMinutes":18,"rating":8,"thumbnail":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w300/pYOJMdlN2BvHYxdwPMtMy72jqOw.jpg","stills":[{"type":"still","url":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/pYOJMdlN2BvHYxdwPMtMy72jqOw.jpg","language":"xx"}],"sourceUrl":"https://www.themoviedb.org/tv/70311/season/3/episode/12"}],"sourceUrl":"https://www.themoviedb.org/tv/70311/season/3"},"failure":null,"fields":{},"episodes":{"1":{"checkedAt":1793454821726,"status":"ok","retryCount":0},"2":{"checkedAt":1793454821726,"status":"ok","retryCount":0},"3":{"checkedAt":1793